                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamuru Joshuwa, mwana wa Nuni, achimuamba, “Ukale imara na hodari, mana undaalongoza Aiziraeli kpwenye tsi ambayo nkaapa kuapha nami nindakala phamwenga nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
